# Be as in complex_orbs_be_hf_saddle, with the orbitals blocked by
# parity (for an atom, that of l), which the occupation file gives in
# its fourth column. The broken-symmetry minimum polarizes the 2s
# orbitals of the two spins with 2p0 in opposite directions; within the
# symmetry, the spin-symmetric solution is the minimum.
System Be.xyz
Basis cc-pVDZ
Method HF
Multiplicity 1
Restricted false
ComplexBasis true
InversionSymmetry true
LinearOccupations -1
LinearOccupationFile complex_orbs_be_hf_inversion.linocc
JKMethod Cholesky
TrustRegion true
SaveChk complex_orbs_be_hf_inversion.chk
